          "He's fifty.",
          "Ele tem 50."
        ],
        [
          "How old is she?",
          "She's twenty-one.",
          "Ela tem 21."
        ],
        [
          "How old is it?",
          "It's ten years old.",
          "Tem 10 anos (coisa)."
        ]
      ]
    },
